  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InterAccountTransfers\">Inter Account Transfers</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And BankAndCashAccounts Business Count On To ToDate Transfer\">Inter-account transfers allow you to record the movement of money between your bank and cash accounts within the same business.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Bank_account BankAccount Count Deposit From FromDate Is Never On Other Rent To ToDate Transfer\">Use this feature whenever you need to move funds from one account to another, such as depositing cash into a bank account, withdrawing cash from the bank, or transferring money between different bank accounts.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-alt-to-right text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InterAccountTransfers\">Inter Account Transfers</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Transfer\">Creating Transfers</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Count Create InterAccountTransfer NewInterAccountTransfer On To ToDate Transfer\">To create a new inter-account transfer, click the <strong>New Inter Account Transfer</strong> button.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg flex gap-4 shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InterAccountTransfers\">Inter Account Transfers</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewInterAccountTransfer\">New Inter Account Transfer</span></span></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account And Count Is On Payment Receipt To ToDate Transfer\">You can also convert existing <em>Payment</em> and <em>Receipt</em> pairs into inter-account transfers.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Actual And Count Create Import Is On Payment Payments Port Rate Receipt Receipts Sent Statement To ToDate Transfer\">This is particularly useful when importing bank statements. The import process may create separate payments and receipts that actually represent transfers between your accounts. These can be easily converted to proper inter-account transfers for cleaner record-keeping.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"On Payment Receipt To ToDate\">Learn how to convert payment/receipt pairs:</span> <a href=\"/guides/new-inter-account-transfers\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewInterAccountTransfer\">New Inter Account Transfer</span></a></p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is Transfer\">Working with the Transfer List</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Column Columns Count Is On Transfer\">The table below displays all your inter-account transfers with key information organized in columns.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Column Count Date On Transfer\">The <strong>Date</strong> column shows when the transfer between accounts occurred.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And BankReconciliation Date Import Is On Port Reconciliation\">This date is important for <em>bank reconciliation</em> and tracking the timing of fund movements.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Column Count Is On Reference Transfer\">The <strong>Reference</strong> column displays the unique reference number for each inter-account transfer.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And On Reference Statement Transfer\">Reference numbers help you identify and track specific transfers, especially when reconciling bank statements.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PaidFrom\">Paid from</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PaidFrom\">Paid from</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account BankOrCashAccount Column Count From FromDate On Paid PaidFrom\">The <strong>Paid From</strong> column shows the bank or cash account from which money was withdrawn.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Amount Balance By Count Is Transfer\">This is the source account that will have its balance reduced by the transfer amount.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ReceivedIn\">Received in</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ReceivedIn\">Received in</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account BankOrCashAccount Column Count Deposit HasWhere Is On Received ReceivedIn\">The <strong>Received In</strong> column displays the bank or cash account where money was deposited.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Amount Balance By Count Is On Transfer\">This is the destination account that will have its balance increased by the transfer amount.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Contains Description Notes On Optional Transfer\">The <strong>Description</strong> column contains optional notes or details about the transfer.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is On Other Reference To ToDate Transfer\">Use this field to record the reason for the transfer or any other relevant information for future reference.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Column Net On Transfer\">The <strong>Amount</strong> column shows the monetary value of each transfer.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Is To ToDate Total Transfer\">The total sum of all transfers is displayed at the bottom of this column, helping you see the overall movement of funds.</p></div></details><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Column Columns Custom Customize Edit EditColumns Is On To ToDate\">You can customize which columns are visible by clicking the <strong>Edit Columns</strong> button to show only the information you need.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pb-4 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 p-3 border-b\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"border text-xs rounded py-1 px-2 bg-white border-neutral-300 text-neutral-400\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"EditColumns\">Edit columns</span></span></div></div></div><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Columns Custom LearnMore To ToDate\">Learn more about customizing columns:</span> <a href=\"/guides/edit-columns\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"EditColumns\">Edit columns</span></a></p>",
  "key": "inter-account-transfers"
}
